{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09646","headline":"下外江舟怀终南旧居 · 岑参","name":"下外江舟怀终南旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杉冷晓猿悲，楚客心欲绝。\n孤舟巴山雨，万里阴台月。\n水宿已淹时，芦花白如雪。\n颜容老难赬，把镜悲鬓发。\n早年好金丹，方士传口诀。\n敝庐终南下，久与真侣别。\n道书谁更开，药竈烟遂灭。\n顷来压尘网，安得有仙骨。\n岩壑归去来，公卿是何物。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}